This product includes C64-specific interoperability data whose individual
source attributions are recorded with the bundled profile and codec tables.

The bundled PETSCII and screen-code tables are transcribed from Appendices B
and C of the Commodore 64 Programmer's Reference Guide, published by
Commodore Business Machines, Inc. The package data records the source URL and
printed page references.
